{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Proclaim.</b> The word of HaShem to His prophet: Cry with the throat, do not hold back the cry. For חָשַׁךְ is a transitive verb." "<b>Like a shofar.</b> So that all will hear."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 58, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:02.575172332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}